---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Navbar from "../../components/react/Navbar";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import CtaBand from "../../components/CtaBand.astro";
import Comments from "../../components/Comments.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../../config";
---

<Layout
	title="M-Pesa Till vs Paybill: Fees & Which to Pick (2026) | Orbit"
	description="Till vs Paybill 2026: fees, account numbers, settlement and which suits you. Decision tree + fee calculator."
>
	<Navbar client:load />
	<main id="main">
		<section class="relative overflow-hidden border-b border-white/5">
			<div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0" aria-hidden="true">
				<div class="absolute -top-40 left-1/3 h-[400px] w-[600px] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-full bg-electric/15 blur-[130px]"></div>
			</div>
			<div class="relative mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 pb-14 pt-20 md:pt-28">
				<p class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-electric">■ Guides · M-Pesa · 4 min</p>
				<h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">
					Till vs Paybill: <span class="text-gradient">pick right once.</span>
				</h1>
				<p class="mt-5 text-lg text-slate-400">Wrong choice = fees + reconciliation hell for years. 3-minute decision + real fee math.</p>
			</div>
		</section>

		<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16">
			<div class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-8">
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Till — walk-in</h2>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Customer pays to your store number in person, no account number. Money lands instantly. Best for shops, salons, eateries, counters.</p>
					<ul class="mt-4 grid gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300"><li>→ No account field = faster but untracked</li><li>→ Staff sees payment instantly</li></ul>
				</div>
				<div class="glow-border rounded-2xl p-8">
					<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">Paybill — tracked</h2>
					<p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-400">Customer enters business no. + account no. That field auto-matches to invoice/client — gold for online/retainer.</p>
					<ul class="mt-4 grid gap-1.5 text-xs text-slate-300"><li>→ Account = auto-reconciliation</li><li>→ Needed for website checkout API</li></ul>
				</div>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-6 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<h3 class="font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-electric">Decision tree</h3>
				<ol class="mt-3 grid gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300 list-decimal list-inside">
					<li>Payment happens <strong class="text-white">face-to-face</strong>? → Till</li>
					<li>Payment happens <strong class="text-white">online/invoice</strong> with needing to know WHO paid? → Paybill</li>
					<li>Both? → Run both: Till at counter, Paybill on website/API. Our stores wire both.</li>
				</ol>
			</div>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">Fee math (do before choosing)</h2>
			<p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400">Safaricom fees shift — so don't trust a screenshot. Use live math:</p>
			<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
				<a href="/mpesa-fee-calculator" class="inline-flex rounded-full btn-gradient px-6 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">Open M-Pesa fee calculator →</a>
				<span class="inline-flex items-center text-xs text-slate-400">Try: Till 1,500 vs Paybill 1,500 → see what you actually keep</span>
			</div>
			<div class="mt-6 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-edge">
				<table class="w-full text-left text-sm"><thead class="bg-panel text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-slate-400"><tr><th class="px-4 py-2">Example sale</th><th class="px-4 py-2">Fee range*</th><th class="px-4 py-2">You keep</th></tr></thead>
				<tbody class="divide-y divide-edge text-slate-300"><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">KES 1,000</td><td class="px-4 py-2">~ 10–20</td><td class="px-4 py-2">980–990</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">KES 5,000</td><td class="px-4 py-2">~ 45–65</td><td class="px-4 py-2">4,935–4,955</td></tr><tr><td class="px-4 py-2">KES 1,500 online</td><td class="px-4 py-2">calc →</td><td class="px-4 py-2"><a href="/mpesa-fee-calculator" class="text-electric hover:underline">calculate</a></td></tr></tbody></table>
			</div>
			<p class="mt-2 text-xs text-slate-500">*Illustrative — fees update; calculator pulls current Daraja bands.</p>

			<h2 class="mt-10 text-xl font-bold text-white">How each wires to a website</h2>
			<ul class="mt-4 grid gap-2 text-sm text-slate-300">
				<li>→ Till via STK Push or API still works — but no account reference for auto-matching orders.</li>
				<li>→ Paybill via Daraja C2B gives you account ref = order ID, so inventory + receipts auto.</li>
				<li>→ Orbit wires both; pick after fee math, not before.</li>
			</ul>

			<div class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-edge bg-panel p-6">
				<p class="text-sm font-semibold text-white">Where Orbit fits</p>
				<p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-400">We connect either/both to your store with STK + callback, test on Till & Paybill, hand over credentials. <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Orbit! I need help choosing Till vs Paybill for my business.")} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-electric hover:underline">Ask free on WhatsApp →</a></p>
			</div>
		</article>

		<Comments slug="mpesa-till-vs-paybill" />
		<CtaBand title="Selling online or at the counter?" text="We wire both — tell us what you sell." />
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
